%% 05 · Runtime — the player (web/player/player.js) and grounded Q&A (server/agents/qa.py)
flowchart TD
  START["USER chooses Explore with me or Browse at my pace<br/>[ask]"]:::ask
  PRELOAD["preload all authored speech + opening film<br/>[FUNCTION · retained Audio/Video objects]<br/>intake, narration, deeper lines, check-ins, FAQ, fillers and closing"]:::fn
  HERO["hero slide on stage<br/>[FUNCTION · showSlideView(hero_open)]<br/>web/slide.js native-aspect fit · benefit heading + evidence panel · reveal recomputes leaders · dock height reserves readable space"]:::data
  Q1["speak the ONE intake question<br/>[LIBRARY · bundle audio, else /run/tts, else Web Speech]<br/>greeting + product + 'what are you buying it for, or shall we start?' (P02)"]:::data
  L1["one owned response turn<br/>[LIBRARY · Sarvam STT offloaded by asyncio.to_thread, or Web Speech recognition]<br/>typing always visible · capture can stop, question stays open until answer or Skip"]:::data
  P1["retain actual need + optional name + focus topics<br/>[FUNCTION · parseName / parseFocus — regex + chip/segment keywords, NO LLM]"]:::fn
  FILM["polite acknowledgement → opening film (overlay on the hero slide) → spoken return<br/>[FUNCTION · playIntroFilm]<br/>planner runs under recorded cover; film capped at 45 s; customer may skip"]:::fn
  OPEN["SHORT STANDARD OPENING · no repeated discovery<br/>[FUNCTION · playOpening]<br/>intro (frame) + outcome (end state first) · pre-rendered audio"]:::fn
  PITCH["pitch plan (starts before the film)<br/>[AGENT · RUNTIME_PROVIDERS gemini → claude → runware, 15 s each · POST /run/pitch refine=true]<br/>whole synchronous plan offloaded by asyncio.to_thread so cached media stays responsive<br/>in: needs + focus, current script proof library, USPs, registry<br/>out: customer state, decision frame, route, custom batches, advance"]:::agent
  PV["grounding + visual validators<br/>[FUNCTION · pitch.plan_pitch / visuals.for_text_and_facts]<br/>segment ids exist · uncited claim dropped · multi-fact batch→card · establish last"]:::fn
  DF["decision frame on a transient slide + speech<br/>[LIBRARY · /run/tts offloads strict selected-voice synthesis by asyncio.to_thread]"]:::data
  CUSTOM["custom proof batches as transient slides<br/>[FUNCTION · transientSlide]<br/>named picture → reviewed slide covering every cited fact → neutral hero · complete reviewed labels first · whole qualified fact ≤8 words else omit"]:::fn
  FALL["fallback: keyword focus order without a second intake question<br/>[FUNCTION] after opening: 150 ms, spoken cover, then 2.5 s; request retained across interruptions"]:::fn
  PLAN["route = ordered content slides + establish<br/>[FUNCTION · buildRoute — pitch route by segment_id → slide]"]:::fn
  LINE["play slide: bridge, then lines<br/>[FUNCTION · playFrom / playLines]<br/>showSlideView cross-fades the slide · setRevealed(j) BEFORE line j's audio · legacy question / confirm step waits for a reply · completed statement → next line · next slide preloaded"]:::fn
  TRX["true transcript<br/>[FUNCTION · logHeard]<br/>an agent line is logged when its audio ENDS; cut off → heard prefix (currentTime / duration × words) marked interrupted; only this history goes to /run/qa"]:::fn
  CHK["check-in question<br/>[LIBRARY · audio] then chips"]:::data
  WAIT["owned waitFor, no auto-advance countdown<br/>[FUNCTION · interpretReply — exact confirmations]<br/>voice or typed answer settles once · typing cancels capture and keeps typed waits until explicit mic · automatic listening only in voice mode · late transcripts ignored · qualified yes goes to Q&A"]:::fn
  DEEP["deeper lines (2-3, pre-authored)<br/>[FUNCTION]"]:::fn
  QIN["question text<br/>[ask · voice or 💬 typed]<br/>stamps: voice ended · STT done (typed: both at submit) → QA done → first answer audio → session.turns"]:::ask
  QA["POST /api/demos/id/run/qa<br/>[AGENT · RUNTIME_PROVIDERS gemini → claude → runware, 15 s each, one retry; all fail → decline + callback]<br/>bank stays local; synchronous live answer + speech offloaded by asyncio.to_thread<br/>in: question, the TRUE transcript (last 8 turns), profile, current slide_id, registry, visuals, CTAs<br/>out: answer, fact_ids, visual, escalate, topic, cta, answered + slide_id, route, callout_id"]:::agent
  QV{"valid?<br/>[FUNCTION · qa.answer]<br/>fact_ids ⊆ approved registry (including bank hits) AND (answered OR no number/claim words)"}:::dec
  RT{"where does the answer live?<br/>[FUNCTION · deck.slides_with_script then route_for]<br/>current reviewed narration/deeper citations + saved slide design · answer fact ids ∩ each slide's facts, else question words vs topics / titles · bank and live answers use the same join · NO LLM"}:::dec
  JUMP["jump: await cached bridge_to_custom (else generic speak) before cross-fade · canceled run cannot jump · then all callouts shown, matching one lit · slide marked covered<br/>[FUNCTION · speakF + showSlideView + highlight]<br/>first answer audio stamped after the bridge; exact return point retained"]:::fn
  SPEAK["speak the answer on the current slide (stay · none: matching callout lit) or on the target (jump)<br/>[FUNCTION]"]:::fn
  NOG["say 'I don't know from the material' without a source card<br/>[FUNCTION] question → understanding.unknowns (origin runtime) · offer optional dealer-help form · hold playback"]:::term
  LEAD{"customer says call me / gives a number?<br/>[FUNCTION · offerCallback, regex [6-9]\\d{9}]"}:::dec
  SAVE["consent line shown → POST /run/lead → leads/*.json (+ DynamoDB row on AWS)<br/>[DATA] refused without consent · read back the number"]:::data
  CONF["'Did that answer it?' → owned turn<br/>[FUNCTION] Yes that helps · Not quite · full follow-up question"]:::fn
  LP{"customer explicitly resolves this question?<br/>[FUNCTION]<br/>Yes that helps / Continue demo"}:::dec
  POP["test-drive / dealer-help form<br/>[ask]<br/>name + ten-digit phone + consent; dismissible; narration stays parked"]:::ask
  RES["resume after explicit resolution: spoken bridge → saved phase, slide and line; completed opening lines are not replayed; follow-ups retain the original checkpoint<br/>[FUNCTION · resumeAfterQA]"]:::fn
  CLOSE["advance (personalised from the pitch plan, else closing lines) → CTA chips + Not yet<br/>[FUNCTION · closeFlow]"]:::fn
  HAND["customer recap (actual topics + open questions, no internal scoring) → POST /run/session (Done, Stop and tab-close sendBeacon, one id per visit)<br/>first handoff freezes elapsed and final-slide dwell · explicit return excludes stopped idle · Restart resets timing<br/>[FUNCTION · storage.backend(): local files · AWS adds a DynamoDB row + S3 mirror]<br/>then ONE lite call writes the follow-up summary from the TRUE transcript (record facts copied by code) · Studio › Sessions · keyed read-only share link, phones masked"]:::data

  START --> PRELOAD --> HERO --> Q1 --> L1 --> P1 --> FILM --> OPEN
  P1 -.->|"starts before film"| PITCH --> PV
  OPEN --> DF --> CUSTOM --> PLAN
  PV --> DF
  PITCH -.->|"timeout / error"| FALL --> PLAN
  PLAN --> LINE --> CHK
  LINE -.->|"every spoken line"| TRX
  CHK --> WAIT
  WAIT -- "explicit continue" --> LINE
  WAIT -- "deeper" --> DEEP --> WAIT
  WAIT -- "question" --> QIN --> QA --> QV
  QV -- "yes" --> RT
  RT -- "stay / none" --> SPEAK
  RT -- "jump" --> JUMP --> SPEAK
  SPEAK --> CONF --> LP
  QV -- "no" --> NOG --> POP --> HOLD
  HOLD -- "ask another" --> QIN
  HOLD -- "Continue demo" --> RES
  LP -- "yes" --> RES
  LP -- "no / silence" --> HOLD["hold the current conversational turn<br/>Ask another · Continue demo"]:::ask
  LEAD -- "yes" --> SAVE --> HOLD
  LEAD -- "no / continue" --> RES
  QIN -.->|"explicit call request / phone"| LEAD
  QV -.->|"clarification only, before any answer"| CLAR["one clarifying question · typed or spoken reply<br/>same original question + transcript + profile.followup"]:::ask --> QA
  LINE -- "last segment" --> CLOSE --> HAND
  QIN -.->|"interrupt at any moment cancels speech (run token) → logHeard partial"| LINE

